&#160;December 31, 2027.</div><div>According to the agreement, the wage increase for the first half of 2026 will be 14%, for the second half of 2026, the sum of the change in Türkiye Consumer Price Index (CPI) and 3% of that change, and for the first and second half of 2027 change in Türkiye Consumer Price Index (CPI) and 3% of that change for the respective periods.</div><div><br/></div><div>Respectfully announced to the public.</div></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>"],"attachments":[]}]